#NEXUS

[ longrich2013a_fig14: Oviraptorosaur time tree, root at the bottom. OVIRAPTORIDAE and CAENAGNATHIDAE, written up the stems of their nodes, are kept as internal labels; AVIMIMIDAE is written up Avimimus' own line (a single tip) and is not encoded. Multi-way nodes, where a tip line meets the node's horizontal at the stem: Ingenia-Nemegtomaia-Heyuannia, Caenagnathasia-Elmisaurus-the rest, and Leptorhynchos elegans, L. gaddisi, Hagryphus and the Chirostenotes node. Replacement for ramírez-velasco2022a_fig4 (seed 20261203). 23 tips, 3 polytomies (3, 3, 4 children); 2 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Sample 4 case (census 2, seed 20261201). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=23;
    TAXLABELS
        Incisivosaurus
        Caudipteryx
        Avimimus
        Oviraptor
        Rinchenia
        Citipati
        Zamyn_Khondt
        Khaan
        Conchoraptor
        Machairasaurus
        Ingenia
        Nemegtomaia
        Heyuannia
        Microvenator
        Gigantoraptor
        Caenagnathasia
        Elmisaurus
        Leptorhynchos_elegans
        Leptorhynchos_gaddisi
        Hagryphus
        Chirostenotes
        Caenagnathus_collinsi
        Caenagnathus_sp.
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE longrich2013a_fig14 = [&R] (Incisivosaurus,(Caudipteryx,(Avimimus,(((Oviraptor,(Rinchenia,(Citipati,Zamyn_Khondt))),(Khaan,(Conchoraptor,(Machairasaurus,(Ingenia,Nemegtomaia,Heyuannia)))))OVIRAPTORIDAE,(Microvenator,(Gigantoraptor,(Caenagnathasia,Elmisaurus,(Leptorhynchos_elegans,Leptorhynchos_gaddisi,Hagryphus,(Chirostenotes,(Caenagnathus_collinsi,Caenagnathus_sp.))))))CAENAGNATHIDAE))));
END;
